      "body": "## Motivation\n\nTwo test registrations name suites that no workflow dispatches, so these tests never run in any CI.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `hicache/test_hicache_storage_3fs_backend.py`: `register_amd_ci` used the CUDA suite name `base-b-test-2-gpu-large`. Register it on `extra-a-test-2-gpu-large-amd`, the AMD counterpart of the `extra-a` / `2-gpu-large` tier its CUDA registration moved to in #47619.\n- `unit/layers/attention/test_fp8_fused_writer_hip.py`: registered on `stage-a-test-cpu-amd`, which has no job. Its five checks are CPU-only wrapper checks, so register it with `register_cpu_ci` in `base-a-test-cpu`.\n\nBoth fixes are taken from #47179, which will be narrowed to its AMD Extra status reporting.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `test_fp8_fused_writer_hip.py` passes on the CPU runner: 5 tests OK in [this rerun-test-cpu job](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40812228366/job/123245099055). The file and the module it tests have not changed since.\n- The 3FS test passed on an AMD 2-GPU runner in [this run](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/40812219513) from #47179.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41615334599](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41615334599)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41615334496](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41615334496)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41615334696](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41615334696)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n\n> [!TIP]\n> Base CI only covers the core cases, and its workload may not exercise your change. Use `/rerun-test` to run the tests your change touches, or copy this prompt for an agent:\n>\n> ```text\n> Find the registered tests this PR affects and run them with /rerun-test, following https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.agents/skills/rerun-test/SKILL.md\n> ```\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
